<h3><u>Hay lazawaal deher me</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Tayree wafa ghazee hay baqa ghazee) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Hay lazawaal dahar main tayree wafa ghazee) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Fana nehi jisay markay hay wo baqa ghazi</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Tayree wafa ghazee...</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Faqat muheet nehi kerbala pay iski wafa</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Qadam qadam pay hua moula par fida ghazi</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Tayree wafa ghazee...</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Labay furat say zahra ki arahee thi sada</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Tu mayri baitee ka wahid tha asira ghazi</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Tayree wafa ghazee...</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Khayamay alay aba main hua hay hashr bapa</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Ali kay laal say jis dam hua juda ghazi</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Tayree wafa ghazee...</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Rahi Hay dair talak bazoo chumti Zainab</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Ummulbanin ko jim dam hua ata ghazi</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Tayree wafa ghazee...</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Ameer iska badal koee nehi zamanay main</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Jahan mein mulkay wafa ka hay kibriya ghazi</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Tayree wafa ghazee...</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Fana nehi jisay markay hay wo baqa ghazi</span></font></div></p>
                 
                